{"text": "In 1830, only a few miles away from what is now the great city of Cincinnati, lay an immense and almost unbroken forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The restless pioneers who had first settled the region soon pushed farther west, but a few of them remained, and Murlock was one of these. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He lived alone in a small log house surrounded on all sides by the forest, of whose gloom and silence he seemed to be a part. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was never known to smile or to waste a word, and he supported himself by hunting and by selling animal skins in the river town. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His cabin had a single door and, directly opposite, a single window, but the window was boarded up, and nobody could remember a time when it was not. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nobody knew why it was closed, and it was certainly not because he disliked the light, for passing hunters often saw him sunning himself on his doorstep. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I believe there are few persons living today who know the secret of that window, but I happen to be one of them, as you shall see. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Murlock was said to be about fifty, yet with his white hair, his long white beard, and his deeply lined face, he looked closer to seventy.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "1", "8", "3", "0", ",", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "f", "e", "w", " ", "m", "i", "l", "e", "s", " ", "a", "w", "a", "y", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "w", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "w", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "e", "a", "t", " ", "c", "i", "t", "y", " ", "o", "f", " ", "C", "i", "n", "c", "i", "n", "n", "a", "t", "i", ",", " ", "l", "a", "y", " ", "a", "n", " ", "i", "m", "m", "e", "n", "s", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", "l", "m", "o", "s", "t", " ", "u", "n", "b", "r", "o", "k", "e", "n", " ", "f", "o", "r", "e", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " "